    "q-143802": {
      "dom_id": "questionContainer",
      "name": "Question 43",
      "problem": "A random variable $X$ has the probability distribution given below.\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}, & x=0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}, & x=1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}, & x=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{3}].$",
      "worked_solution": "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{3}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{3}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each cubed value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{3}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & ={0}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+{1}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+{2}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =0\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+1\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+8\\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =0+\\frac{1}{4}+2 \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143802-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{9}{2}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"125\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143802-b",
